campus network. myLOFT(my Library On Fingertips) Access subscribed journal publications and e-books at the comfort of your hostel, home, and any other other location via myLoft Library App. USTED Knowledge Manager Access the Institutional Research Output of the University including Thesis and Dissertations, Reports and Memoranda, Conference Proceedings, Article pre-prints and post-prints, Open Access Publications, and other Open Artefacts Proquest Ebooks Borrow from the best e-book collection available. Requires registration. TRIAL ACCESS USTED LIBCAT Search or browse our holdings (book titles) to locate them physically in the Library E-Learning Courses (MOOCS) Learn for additional skills from top open education providers; Coursera, EDX, OASIS,  Merlot, Edmodo, Udemy. Open Educational Resources OER Commons is a public digital library of open educational resources. Explore, create, and collaborate with educators around the world to improve curriculum. Drillbit DrillBit Plagiarism Checker helps students assess the originality of their academic writing by generating similarity reports, AI-content detection reports, and grammar accuracy insights, enabling them to improve their work and uphold academic and intellectual integrity Research Databases A-Z An alphabetical and subject listing of academic databases offering full-text articles, books, images and videos. Requires campus network. Off-Campus Access (RomoteX) Provides remote access to the library's resources at the comfort of your location. Requires registration Proquest Ebooks Borrow from the best e-book collection available. Requires registration. AAMUSTED LIBCAT Search or browse our holdings (book titles) to locate them physically in the Library E-Learning Courses (MOOCS) Learn for additional skills from top open education providers; Coursera, EDX, OASIS,  Merlot, Edmodo, Udemy. Open Educational Resources OER Commons is a public digital library of open educational resources. Explore, create, and collaborate with 